		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  XID wraparound]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=29134#p29134"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>lengow=&gt; select datname, datfrozenxid from pg_database ;<br />&#160; datname&#160; &#160;| datfrozenxid <br />------------+--------------<br /> postgres&#160; |&#160; &#160;4039956812<br /> ******&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160;3924274179<br /> template1 |&#160; &#160;3998600242<br /> template0 |&#160; &#160;3998600242<br /> **********&#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160;4010500360<br /> ******&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160;4010500360<br /> *****&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160;4010500360<br />(7 rows)</p><br /><br /><p>lengow=&gt; select txid_current();&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br /> txid_current <br />--------------<br />&#160; &#160;4123673365<br />(1 row)</p>]]></content>
